    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋiticisyo ŋulu egelegelya ŋulu abu Solomon kitiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku a ŋikaru a ŋatomoniarei, kedau Solomon akiduk Akai ke Ekapolon ka ŋina keŋ ke elope, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abu Solomon todukok nabo ŋitaunio ŋulu ainakini Iram iŋes ka abu ya Ŋisirael kiboikinos lotaunio ŋul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon kicodo a nen nakibois ŋina anyaritae Amas-Soba, kikama akibois ŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Solomon todukok etaun ŋolo anyaritae Tadimor naloŋisat kaapei ka ŋitaunio ŋulu abu iŋes todukok Amas ŋulu aya ŋisitowae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ iŋes toduk Bes-Oron ŋolo ayai neni amukur ka Bes-Oron ŋolo ayai neni adipal, adukitoe ŋarwatatain ŋuna abutur lotaunio ŋul, toya ŋipukei ŋulu a ŋasuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu daŋ Solomon todukok Baalas arwatata ŋina abutur ka ŋipukei ŋulu a ŋasuwa ka ŋitaunio daadaŋ ŋulu aya ŋisitowae ka ŋulu a ŋagaari keŋ ka ŋaŋolei keŋ ta ŋaduketa ca daadaŋ ŋuna abu Solomon totamak adukokin Yerusalem, Lebanon ka nakwap daadaŋ ŋina epukat iŋes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋipiya daadaŋ ŋulu a ŋituŋa a lu: A Ŋiitaiti, a Ŋiamori, a Ŋiperisi, a Ŋiipi ka a Ŋiyebusi, ŋulu pa arae Ŋisirael, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋipapae a ŋituŋa a ŋul daadaŋ ŋulu kepotu Ŋisirael nyemunyasi, abu Solomon toreik ŋul daadaŋ akitiya etic, ido eriŋa tari tokona ereikinitae ikes etic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai ani eruwor Ŋisirael, pa abu Solomon kituruwo ikes ŋipi alotic keŋ; arae ikes ŋasigarya, ŋikapolok anapukan keŋ, ŋikarikok a ŋajorei keŋ ka ŋikarikok a ŋajorei a ŋuna adokito ŋagaari ka ŋaŋolei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lo ekimar a ŋikapolok a ŋulu apolokinito ŋiticisyo a erwosit Solomon, arae ikes ŋamiae ŋaarei ka ŋatomonikan, ikes apolokinito ŋituŋa ŋulu etiyaete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Solomon ya nakoku a Parao alotaun a Daudi, kisiboik kai ŋina abu iŋes toduk aŋuna a nakoku a Parao, anerae abu Solomon tema, “Nyemaikina aberu kaŋ iboi alokai a Daudi a erwosit a Ŋisirael, anerae esegak ŋakiboisyo ŋuna ewuakin Asaduku ŋina ka Acamunet ke Ekapolon.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau ŋun, abu Solomon inak Ekapolon ŋainakineta ŋuna epeyo a Namuroet a ŋina ke Ekapolon a ŋina abu iŋes todukok ebarasan ŋolo ayai kiŋaren Akai ka Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etiyae iŋes ŋun ikwapei etic ŋolo amaikina iŋes kitiya a ŋinakoloŋit, lopite ŋolo ecikitor Moses ainanakin edoli akoloŋit ŋina a Sabato, ŋina elomunia elap ka ŋapakio ŋuna a ŋasuban a ŋunauni a ŋuna a ŋolokaru. Ŋasuban ŋun ikes nu: Ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋamugati a ŋuna emam ŋakinyalet, ŋasuban ŋuna a ŋikinyom a ŋulukitet ka ŋasuban ŋuna edukere ŋisakaitei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋuna ewuapitor Solomon ŋuna atubunit sek papa keŋ Daudi, abu iŋes toseu ŋatukon a ŋisacaradotin, inak ŋinatukot etic keŋ, tolimok ŋilepi arikit aeore ka akiŋarakinit ŋisacaradotin alotic kec a ŋolo a ŋinakoloŋit. Abu daŋ Solomon toseu ŋatukon a ŋikedarak ŋipukei, kiwuak a ŋolopuke ŋikedarak keŋ, anerae ŋuna sek kebu Daudi ituŋanan ŋini ka Akuj kicik iŋes ŋun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋatukon ŋun nyiwuap ŋace, mati ŋuna ecikit erwosit ŋisacaradotin ka ŋilepi akiyokit ebari ka akitiya ŋiticisyo daadaŋ ŋulu amaikina ikes kitiyata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun, abu etic a Solomon daadaŋ tolot kiŋaren ejok, ameun akoloŋit ŋina esyakinere adukokin Akai ke Ekapolon tari ŋina erikakinere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolot nai Solomon Esion-Geber ka Elos nakiboisyo ŋuna aya diyete anam alo Edom. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyakik Iram Solomon ŋameeli ŋuna arae ŋikapolok ŋulu epukatotor iŋes apolokinito, ayenete ŋikilyok ŋul anam ejok. Apotu ŋikilyok ŋul kaapei ka ŋulu a Solomon toloto Opir a ŋameeli, yaut a nen ŋatalantae ŋamiae ŋaomwon ka ŋatomonikan ŋuna ke egolid, inakis erwosit Solomon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
